<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="hi">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>Somil General Store</title>

<style>
*{
  box-sizing:border-box;
  margin:0;
  padding:0;
}

body{
  font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
  background:#f7f8ff;
  color:#222;
}

header{
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,#6c2cff,#ff3d81);
  color:white;
  text-align:center;
  padding:30px 15px;
}

header h1{
  font-size:30px;
  margin-bottom:8px;
}

header p{
  font-size:15px;
}

.hero{
  text-align:center;
  background:white;
  padding:35px 18px;
}

.hero h2{
  color:#6c2cff;
  font-size:28px;
  margin-bottom:12px;
}

.hero p{
  line-height:1.6;
  margin:7px 0;
}

.section{
  padding:30px 15px;
  max-width:1000px;
  margin:auto;
}

.title{
  text-align:center;
  color:#6c2cff;
  margin-bottom:25px;
}

.category{
  margin:25px 0 15px;
  font-size:22px;
}

.products{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);
  gap:15px;
}

.product{
  background:white;
  border-radius:16px;
  padding:12px;
  text-align:center;
  box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.08);
}

.product img{
  width:100%;
  height:160px;
  object-fit:contain;
  border-radius:12px;
  background:#fafafa;
}

.product h3{
  font-size:17px;
  margin:10px 0 5px;
}

.product p{
  color:#666;
  margin:5px 0;
}

.price{
  color:#e52d55;
  font-size:20px;
  font-weight:bold;
  margin-top:7px;
}

.info{
  background:white;
  padding:20px;
  border-radius:16px;
  line-height:2;
  box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.08);
}

footer{
  background:#222;
  color:white;
  text-align:center;
  padding:22px;
  margin-top:20px;
}

@media(min-width:700px){
  .products{
    grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
  }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
<h1>🛍️ Somil General Store</h1>
<p>आपकी रोज़मर्रा की जरूरतों का भरोसेमंद स्टोर</p>
</header>

