alt="Parle-G Biscuit">

<h3>Parle-G</h3>

<p>₹5 / ₹10</p>

</div>


<div class="product">

<img src="./images/patanjali-biscuit.jpg"
alt="Patanjali Biscuit">

<h3>Patanjali Biscuit</h3>

