</section>


<section class="section">

<h2 class="title">📍 Store Information</h2>

<div class="info">

<p>
🏪 <b>नाम:</b>
Somil General Store
</p>

<p>
📍 <b>स्थान:</b>
Hatta, Damoh, Madhya Pradesh
</p>

<p>
🕘 <b>समय:</b>
सुबह 9:00 AM – रात 9:00 PM
</p>

<p>
📞 <b>Contact:</b>
Business number बाद में जोड़ेंगे
</p>

</div>

</section>


<footer>

<p>© 2026 Somil General Store</p>

<p>आपका अपना General Store ❤️</p>

</footer>

</body>
</html>
